# Layout

Scope: `implesia-mart-backend` only.

A new resource is four layers, in this order:

1. `app/models/` — SQLAlchemy model, checks, and indexes
2. `app/schemas/` — Pydantic request and response models
3. `app/services/` — queries and rules
4. `app/api/v1/endpoints/` — a public router and an `/admin` router

Route handlers stay thin. Business rules live in the service. Schema changes get an Alembic revision. Behavior gets a test in `tests/` and a Bruno request with a body, docs, and an example response.

Do not put a new resource in a single file, and do not call the database from a route.
